{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15213420","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15213420","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1521342001:0":{"text":"あと二日でバルトシアから撤収？ウソだろ……","source_cn":"这两天就要从水泽营地撤走？不是真的吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60045ED8E4CF2EFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521342002:0":{"text":"なんだ、ここにそんな思い入れでもあるのか？","source_cn":"怎么，你还想留在这里不成？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A5A5378FA41C4A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521342003:0":{"text":"これだけ長く駐屯してたら、少しは名残惜しくもなるよ。","source_cn":"是啊。在这驻扎了这么久，多少都有点舍不得。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA76A1F9ECFC314BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521342004:0":{"text":"ようやく戦争も終わったし、獣人の友達もできるかなぁ。","source_cn":"而且战争好不容易才结束，我还想多交几个兽人朋友呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x501C600F2BFF4F96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521342005:0":{"text":"獣人の友達だって？お前、頭がおかしくなったのか？","source_cn":"和兽人交朋友？你脑子出问题了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFF5305021996D49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521342006:0":{"text":"でも、獣人ってかわいいと思わない？動物みたいな耳や尻尾があって、もしかしたらフワフワの肉球まであるのかも！","source_cn":"你不觉得有些兽人长得很可爱吗？有动物一样的耳朵和尾巴，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7C7D8BB35887A95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521342007:0":{"text":"それに毛並みなんかも、うちの犬より滑らかそうだ……","source_cn":"不知道他们的毛摸起来会不会比我家狗的更光滑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F61604EB4FC605E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521342008:0":{"text":"では、ヤクボルの民との恋もあり得ますか？","source_cn":"那么，你会爱上雅库伯尔人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA78A8CF8C39A46E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521342009:0":{"text":"うわっ！噂をすれば、かわいらしい獣人の子が。","source_cn":"哇哦，一个可爱的兽人小姑娘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25906A7D542A91D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521342010:0":{"text":"そうだなぁ……それも悪くないかもね。ヤクボルの女性はみんな強いし、一緒に狩りに出かけたりして……","source_cn":"让我想想……爱上兽人应该也没什么不好的吧。雅库伯尔的女...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08EF02A7323BD68B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521342011:0":{"text":"うん、そうだ……狩りの方が軍隊の勤務より楽しいに決まってる！","source_cn"